{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/34d4fcb3b8a940220b36c91c45bc115c.avif?t=1772791547\" width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The shadows are calling\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Code of Shadows</i> drops you into collapsing dimensions where XP never stops flowing and every decision shapes your survival. Guided by the enigmatic AI <strong>MoiAI</strong>, you\u2019ll face rift-spawned hordes, command your own <strong>drone army</strong>, freeze time to outthink the chaos, and chase a secret that could swallow every world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Safe Area hub, slip through shifting portals into handcrafted biomes stitched together by procedural magic. Every run reshuffles layouts, enemy packs, and story events \u2014 but one rule remains: <strong>progress never sleeps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/4cf822450dfe9696c4de5c852c112395.poster.avif?t=1772791547\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/4cf822450dfe9696c4de5c852c112395.webm?t=1772791547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/4cf822450dfe9696c4de5c852c112395.mp4?t=1772791547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/59a053ef77c5e2b0858ce3b7e79edc8a.poster.avif?t=1772791547\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/59a053ef77c5e2b0858ce3b7e79edc8a.webm?t=1772791547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/59a053ef77c5e2b0858ce3b7e79edc8a.mp4?t=1772791547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Drone Army</strong> \u2013 Summon, upgrade, and command AI companions to flank, shield, or blitz the swarm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Controlled Time</strong> \u2013 Stop the action at will: plan, breathe, or clutch-upgrade mid-battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression</strong> \u2013 Randomised enemies, rewards, and modifiers ensure no two runs feel the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Dimensions</strong> \u2013 Each realm is algorithmically remixed for infinite variety and escalating challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MoiAI Hacking</strong> \u2013 Hijack portals, disable traps, and bend encounters to your favour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Encounters</strong> \u2013 Face world-guardian titans guarding the answers you seek.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylised 3D Visuals</strong> \u2013 Atmospheric lighting, dynamic shadows, and dramatic camera sweeps bring the darkness to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/da446049eb89a0bc38cf9870e5e2f77a.poster.avif?t=1772791547\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/da446049eb89a0bc38cf9870e5e2f77a.webm?t=1772791547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/da446049eb89a0bc38cf9870e5e2f77a.mp4?t=1772791547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unseal forbidden codes, dominate the portals and <i>decide when the world stops</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Code of Shadows to your wishlist today and be ready to unleash your power when the rifts open!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: The demo is currently available in English only. Full localization is planned for Early Access.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424800?t=1772791547","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/af24c07ad75cae96d015efef0d107becbc756dd5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772791547","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/e13ae6cd052d41295fa2b4f601d403de0fcf4c13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772791547","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/e13ae6cd052d41295fa2b4f601d403de0fcf4c13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772791547","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4405310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424800/extras/34d4fcb3b8a940220b36c91c45bc115c.avif?t=1772791547\" width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The shadows are calling\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Code of Shadows</i> drops you into collapsing dimensions where XP never stops flowing and every decision shapes your survival. Guided by the enigmatic AI <strong>MoiAI</strong>, y